{"2851650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paperly: Paper Plane Adventure", "steam_appid": 2851650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Paperly: Paper Plane Adventure is all about flying a paper plane, learning from previous mistakes, and heading toward a better flight in this physics-driven gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>The controls are straightforward: navigate your paper plane with ease using simple directional commands - Up, Down, Left, and Right. Make Gravity your best friend in this journey of exploration and it will act as an engine for your paper plane. Diving down will give you more momentum and Going up will take momentum from your airplane.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/ee499295f1219bacd95f93e3e0fc3994.poster.avif?t=1784880122\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/ee499295f1219bacd95f93e3e0fc3994.webm?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/ee499295f1219bacd95f93e3e0fc3994.mp4?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE WORLDS</h2>Travel through diverse landscapes including dry deserts, tropical forests, icy caves of the Arctic &amp; more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/b60088cf80ee764e0ac2c6a6822fd4b4.poster.avif?t=1784880122\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/b60088cf80ee764e0ac2c6a6822fd4b4.webm?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/b60088cf80ee764e0ac2c6a6822fd4b4.mp4?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNC MODE</h2>Introducing a new Multiplayer Mode! Challenge players from around the world in thrilling head-to-head battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/a643d9f6e5f6b2584c537aac0ba7c295.poster.avif?t=1784880122\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/a643d9f6e5f6b2584c537aac0ba7c295.webm?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/a643d9f6e5f6b2584c537aac0ba7c295.mp4?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE PAPER PLANES</h2>Discover 11 distinct paper planes, each offering a unique design &amp; skin to enhance your flying experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/342b316f70ca1b48de4d00484da81e7b.poster.avif?t=1784880122\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/342b316f70ca1b48de4d00484da81e7b.webm?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851650/extras/342b316f70ca1b48de4d00484da81e7b.mp4?t=1784880122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Paperly: Paper Plane Adventure is all about flying a paper plane, learning from previous mistakes, and heading toward a better flight in this physics-driven gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>The controls are straightforward: navigate your paper plane with e